  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"F3 cycles player_mode 1-3 and sets two_players and two_joysticks from it. It shows the new mode, waits, and clears key_row0."},
    {"at":2,"placement":"side","text":"F3 is bit 5 of keyboard row 0."},
    {"at":8,"placement":"side","text":"A key press restarts the count of tune loops before the demo."},
    {"at":59,"placement":"line","text":"Joystick 1 on the options: down and up change the level, left and right change the start cave by 4. Shows them, then waits."},
    {"at":71,"placement":"side","text":"Down: level minus 1."},
    {"at":81,"placement":"side","text":"Up: level plus 1, at most 4."},
    {"at":95,"placement":"side","text":"The level 4 (shown as 4) sets the start cave back to A."},
    {"at":106,"placement":"side","text":"Left: start cave minus 4."},
    {"at":123,"placement":"side","text":"Right: start cave plus 4, only below level 4 and below cave M."},
    {"at":150,"placement":"side","text":"Shows the level digit and its second half on the title."},
    {"at":163,"placement":"side","text":"Shows the cave letter and its second half on the title."},
    {"at":177,"placement":"line","text":"Runs the title until title_done. F1 opens the options. Fire on the options starts a game. The title tune sets title_done for the demo."},
    {"at":183,"placement":"side","text":"The credits show until F1 opens the options."},
    {"at":200,"placement":"side","text":"F1 is bit 4 of keyboard row 0."},
    {"at":213,"placement":"side","text":"Colour 9 for the screen colour RAM from offset $50."},
    {"at":265,"placement":"side","text":"No code sets two_players to $ff."},
    {"at":294,"placement":"side","text":"Fire clears demo_mode: the game starts."}
  ],
